      "writtenOn": "2013-08-22T20:24:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes; exactly. The Turbo mode can discharge the battery even while connected to the charger. Plus, the spec says not to turn throttling off until it\u0027s been below the threshold for 5 seconds, which means we still need to check while on AC in order for that timeout to be reached.\n\nOtherwise, just plugging the adapter in and out would mess up that 5-second timeout. Since the threshold logic uses signed numbers, everything Just Works.",
